OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be some bright or
OL,6,Fsunny intervals and a few showers
OL,7,Fthese mostly across the Lothians. A
OL,8,Fless windy day and a little milder too.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and
OL,11,Fnight with some clear periods. More
OL,12,Fcloud in the west at times. Winds
OL,13,Fmainly light.
OL,14,
OL,15,CThursday:FThursday will be mainly dry,
OL,16,Fthough quite cloudy with a few light
OL,17,Fshowers especially in the Southwest.
OL,18,FSome sunshine around too, best in the
OL,19,FBorders.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
