OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA dry
OL,6,Fstart Friday then clouding over,
OL,7,Foccasional rain later. Saturday cloudy
OL,8,Fwith occasional rain then Sunday dry
OL,9,Fwith some sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
